            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Meeting summaries point out what matters.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.20</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The crucial points in a meeting summary are underlined, the same way Focus marks your tasks.</li>
  <li>"In Focus" next to one of your next steps opens that task.</li>
  <li>Renaming a speaker shows that it's working, and the people row lines up.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
